WE-MAPI High Temperature Series
High Temperature Series with operating temperature from -55 °C to +150 °C

Applications
DC/DC-converter for high current power supplies
DC/DC-converter for Field Programmable Gate Array (FPGA)
POL-converters
Portable power like PDA, digital camera
Mainboards/graphic cards
Battery powered devices
Wireless communication devices
Power supplies for smartphones, tablet PCs and other mobile devices

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-MAPI

Updated by Ella 2026-09-16
2026(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
