<deviceset name="WE-MAPI_2512HT" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:43486935/5" prefix="L">
<description>WE-MAPI SMT Power Inductor
Shielded

Characteristics
Magnetic iron alloy allows high rated currents
Compact design
Magnetically shielded
High current capability and handles high transient current spikes
Low acoustic noise and low leakage flux noise
AEC-Q 200 qualified
Operating temperature: –40 °C to 125 °C

WE-MAPI High Temperature Series
High Temperature Series with operating temperature from -55 °C to +150 °C

Applications
DC/DC-converter for high current power supplies
DC/DC-converter for Field Programmable Gate Array (FPGA)
POL-converters
Portable power like PDA, digital camera
Mainboards/graphic cards
Battery powered devices
Wireless communication devices
Power supplies for smartphones, tablet PCs and other mobile devices

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-MAPI

Updated by Ella 2024-11-14
2024(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
